Package: qore-uuid-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-uuid-module-doc
Description: UUID generation and manipulation module for Qore
 This module provides the Qore UUID class for generating random and time-based
 universally unique identifiers, parsing identifiers, and comparing, copying,
 and formatting their values. It uses the system libuuid library.
 .
 Compiler metadata is included for Qore's development tools.

Package: qore-uuid-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-uuid-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's UUID module
 This package contains the HTML API reference and example test program for
 the Qore UUID module, which generates and manipulates universally unique
 identifiers using the system libuuid library.
